   "text": "Venezia\u2019 \u2018Venezia\u2019 Stargazer\u2019\n(Aalsmeer, (Monbulk, (Monbulk,\nNetherlands) Victoria) Victoria)\nFLOWER SIZE very large very large large\nFLOWER\nATTITUDE erect erect Semi-erect\nFLOWER COLCURS\ncolour ceed pink dark ree\nRHS number 634-0 634 187A\nINNER TEPALS (OUTER SIDE}\ncolour not available greyec pink greyed pink\nRHS number 186D 1868\nOUTER TEPALS {INNER SIDE)\ncolour deen p rk dark red\nRHS number 634, 1878\nOUTER TEPALS (OUTER SIDE}\ncolour not available greyed o'nk greyed oin<\nRHS number 186D 1860\nTEPAL MARKINGS\ncolour deep pink deep pink darx red\nRHS rumber 59A 1874\nINNER SIDE OF THROAT\ncolour green-white yeilow-green yellow-creer\nRHS number 1458 1448\nBUD ANTHOCYANIN COLOURATION\nnot available light medium\nSTEM\nANTHOCYANIK present present present\n- (light) (medium)\nSTEMCOLOUR light-medium \u2014light-medium \u2014_light-medium\ngreen green green\nUPPER LEAF SURFACE COLOUR,\nColour medium green medium green medium green\nRHS number 1468 147A\nLEAF LENGTH \u2014 long long med um\nmean a 195 mm 1admm\nrange \u201c87 ~ 202 \u201c08 \u2014 *28\nstd. deviation 43 54",
